# علامة نسخ في نهاية كل تقرير

When the user gets a تقرير / report / ملخص تنفيذ / النقاط 1–7:

1. Write the report to `docs/` so it is not trapped in chat.
2. End the **chat message** with this exact marker and a single fenced `text` block that contains the full report. Cursor shows a copy button on that fence — that is the copy mark. Do not wait for the user to ask.

```
📋 نسخ التقرير
```text
...full report here...
```
```

3. The copy block must be self-contained (no “see above”). Prefer plain text over nested markdown tables if they break the fence.
4. Do not ask «هل تريد التقرير؟» and do not require «إذا سمحت».
